   "title": "Note: Guide",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Breeze Voice Remix\n\nRestyle an existing voice without re-recording it: change age, pitch, pace, energy or emotion, and keep the timbre recognisable.\n\n### How to use\n\n1. Sign in with your ComfyUI account. This is an API node, so it bills per use.\n2. Feed **voice** from the Breeze Voice Selector, Voice Design or Voice Clone.\n3. Pick **change**:\n   - `preset` - a fixed list of shifts (age, gender presentation, pitch, pace, energy, emotion, role-play, delivery). This graph uses `Emotion: excited`.\n   - `custom` - write your own prompt, for example \"older and huskier, slower, with a tired laugh\".\n4. `strength` (1 to 10) is how far the result may travel from the source. Around 3 to 5 keeps the person; past 7 it starts to sound like a different performer.\n5. Queue the prompt. The node returns a new `voice` (chain it into Text to Speech) and a spoken `preview` (saved here).\n6. `seed` plus `control_after_generate = fixed` reproduces an exact take.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## Breeze Voice Remix\n\nRestyle an existing voice without re-recording it: change age, pitch, pace, energy or emotion, and keep the timbre recognisable.\n\n### How to use\n\n1. Sign in with your ComfyUI account. This is an API node, so it bills per use.\n2. Feed **voice** from the Breeze Voice Selector, Voice Design or Voice Clone.\n3. Pick **change**:\n   - `preset` - a fixed list of shifts (age, gender presentation, pitch, pace, energy, emotion, role-play, delivery). This graph uses `Emotion: excited`.\n   - `custom` - write your own prompt, for example \"older and huskier, slower, with a tired laugh\".\n4. `strength` (1 to 10) is how far the result may travel from the source. Around 3 to 5 keeps the person; past 7 it starts to sound like a different performer.\n5. Queue the prompt. The node returns a new `voice` (chain it into Text to Speech) and a spoken `preview` (saved here).\n6. `seed` plus `control_after_generate = fixed` reproduces an exact take.\n"
   }
  }
